    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 129,
        "text": "Have you seen the weather forecast for our picnic by the lake? I am bringing the food, so I need to know where we will eat.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3b9cac9691542b5335eab08e35cc39f4fe69ffe7899c1c92975eebcd65d1583f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 135,
        "sourceEnd": 283,
        "text": "Yes. Saturday should be warm, around 22 degrees Celsius, but the afternoon might be rainy. The morning will be sunny according to the latest report.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9f878df30cd2dc1aba7769f495aa0aee90f05e8cfb105d830d2522a27a3e8753",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 290,
        "sourceEnd": 405,
        "text": "There is a dark cloud above the lake already. I think it is going to rain before noon. Should we cancel everything?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "036f3ccc5f0e4cc7ff0e78c7960a450c7cfbf7f376dd1cdd9e9393c96558fbc2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 411,
        "sourceEnd": 529,
        "text": "I would wait. A cloud can pass quickly, and the wind is moving it toward the hills. Let's plan for both possibilities.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "7977b951566cb2aa5c6794892573c284478e21db63475c612ab11aa2ccb28b6b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 536,
        "sourceEnd": 666,
        "text": "Good idea. If it stays dry, we will meet under the large tree at eleven. If rain starts, we will move to the cafe beside the path.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "febe97007634a586dcdb469731234c26c712f0bee612359a8477ccbd6df3f3e2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 672,
        "sourceEnd": 786,
        "text": "I will bring an umbrella and a cloth for the food. The cafe has room for eight people, and our group has only six.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "cdfec5155291ecd508a4f05039f5b4a0a8fdff451540429d52cdb3d46ab6ac65",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 793,
        "sourceEnd": 939,
        "text": "What about a storm? Last summer we heard thunder during a walk, and then we saw lightning. I do not want anyone to stay outside in that situation.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ca958290e3619f34987a0099fddcdb5a8f247e7c12fb71e0069ca20b477a253e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 945,
        "sourceEnd": 1061,
        "text": "If we hear thunder or see lightning, we will go straight inside. We can ask the cafe staff when it is safe to leave.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4c068b21f517ecff517427aa7482d54e8db3c55b76552f8b783dc6bc8c089bd2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 1068,
        "sourceEnd": 1223,
        "text": "The lake looks very different in each season. In winter, fog sometimes hides the other side. I remember one cold, snowy visit when the ground was freezing.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "e99837242298c29f09a2e3bdd9c24fe6f5e53483e8e4dada0a78b296c946ff0c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1229,
        "sourceEnd": 1379,
        "text": "I prefer spring. The climate here is mild, and even a windy day can feel pleasant. Today the humidity is high, though, so let us take plenty of water.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "1fc8312a49092741df99c6e6b428124d3be0977edd5e44d7dee05814491b92c8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 1386,
        "sourceEnd": 1520,
        "text": "Agreed. The sunshine may return later, but we can enjoy lunch indoors too. I will send everyone the two meeting places by nine thirty.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "5a55ab1db34685d130cd89bc28f2629efb4db43ccff8bc259dc42eee15b6928b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1526,
        "sourceEnd": 1602,
        "text": "Thanks. I will check the new report at ten and call you if anything changes.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ab6cede01272eca903eec3fb7b1453438ced8ec3c1874428af79b9712a790778",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      }
    ]
  },
